    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Powerful Special Skills by Robot</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092280/extras/1ee935a0c0d5ea8add3d9ff04c349696.poster.avif?t=1755523317\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092280/extras/1ee935a0c0d5ea8add3d9ff04c349696.webm?t=1755523317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092280/extras/1ee935a0c0d5ea8add3d9ff04c349696.mp4?t=1755523317\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Robots have unique special skills that excel in emergency situations and when facing large numbers of enemies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Main Weapons for Each Robot</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092280/extras/0605390afd0f64e3629c6768d761644e.poster.avif?t=1755523317\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092280/extras/0605390afd0f64e3629c6768d761644e.webm?t=1755523317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092280/extras/0605390afd0f64e3629c6768d761644e.mp4?t=1755523317\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each robot can utilize three main weapons, with two skill trees available for each main weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the formations of sub weapons to create your own unique weapon formation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Growth Through Leveling Up</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092280/extras/be103132f66d2cff102fe1e41c02a39d.poster.avif?t=1755523317\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092280/extras/be103132f66d2cff102fe1e41c02a39d.webm?t=1755523317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092280/extras/be103132f66d2cff102fe1e41c02a39d.mp4?t=1755523317\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By defeating enemies in stages, you gain experience points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reaching certain experience thresholds allows you to level up and choose skill cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Various Bosses</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092280/extras/69df918c329551b7c9515849017074ad.poster.avif?t=1755523317\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092280/extras/69df918c329551b7c9515849017074ad.webm?t=1755523317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092280/extras/69df918c329551b7c9515849017074ad.mp4?t=1755523317\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against unique bosses across a total of 10 stages, each with their own distinct characteristics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tense Boss Battles and Diverse Attack Patterns</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092280/extras/4d7a94ab2f55388ee4dd095eb656c2e8.poster.avif?t=1755523317\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092280/extras/4d7a94ab2f55388ee4dd095eb656c2e8.webm?t=1755523317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092280/extras/4d7a94ab2f55388ee4dd095eb656c2e8.mp4?t=1755523317\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two bosses are the same, and most will randomly use one of three special attack patterns, providing enjoyment even in repeated playthroughs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Growth Elements - Robots and Main Weapons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092280/extras/ebdc4d53a9b15eb381356e00f9be39dd.poster.avif?t=1755523317\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092280/extras/ebdc4d53a9b15eb381356e00f9be39dd.webm?t=1755523317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092280/extras/ebdc4d53a9b15eb381356e00f9be39dd.mp4?t=1755523317\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your robot\u2019s stats and traits using in-game currency gained from gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also unlock and enhance weapon skills to see changes in combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Growth Elements - Sub Weapons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092280/extras/7841b8fa4a8fa6c9ece19d42d28bd3a7.poster.avif?t=1755523317\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092280/extras/7841b8fa4a8fa6c9ece19d42d28bd3a7.webm?t=1755523317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092280/extras/7841b8fa4a8fa6c9ece19d42d28bd3a7.mp4?t=1755523317\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each sub weapon comes with two skill trees.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strengthen and level up your sub weapons to create your own unique weapon formation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Powerful Special Skills by Robot</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092280/extras/1ee935a0c0d5ea8add3d9ff04c349696.poster.avif?t=1755523317\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092280/extras/1ee935a0c0d5ea8add3d9ff04c349696.webm?t=1755523317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092280/extras/1ee935a0c0d5ea8add3d9ff04c349696.mp4?t=1755523317\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Robots have unique special skills that excel in emergency situations and when facing large numbers of enemies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Main Weapons for Each Robot</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092280/extras/0605390afd0f64e3629c6768d761644e.poster.avif?t=1755523317\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092280/extras/0605390afd0f64e3629c6768d761644e.webm?t=1755523317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092280/extras/0605390afd0f64e3629c6768d761644e.mp4?t=1755523317\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each robot can utilize three main weapons, with two skill trees available for each main weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the formations of sub weapons to create your own unique weapon formation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Growth Through Leveling Up</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragra