523317\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092280/extras/7841b8fa4a8fa6c9ece19d42d28bd3a7.webm?t=1755523317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092280/extras/7841b8fa4a8fa6c9ece19d42d28bd3a7.mp4?t=1755523317\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each sub weapon comes with two skill trees.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strengthen and level up your sub weapons to create your own unique weapon formation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
